<div class="podcast-content"><section class="show-introduction"><p>Two perspectives. Real questions.<br><strong>Finding where AI fits in everyday work.</strong></p><a href="#hosts">Meet your co-hosts ↓</a></section>
<section id="episodes" class="episode-section"><header class="section-header" data-episode-heading hidden><h2>Latest conversation</h2><a href="https://www.youtube.com/@exploreAIoutloud/playlists">All episodes on YouTube ↗</a></header><aside class="episode-teaser" aria-labelledby="episode-teaser-title"><p class="eyebrow">Coming soon</p><h2 id="episode-teaser-title">First episode drops <time datetime="2026-09-15">September 15</time></h2><p>Join Santosh and Brandon for the first episode of Explore AI Out Loud.</p><a class="platform youtube-primary" href="https://www.youtube.com/@exploreAIoutloud" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><img src="{{asset "eaol/icons/youtube.png"}}" width="22" height="22" alt="">Subscribe on YouTube</a></aside><p id="episode-status" class="episode-status" role="status"></p><p class="episode-fallback" hidden><a href="https://www.youtube.com/@exploreAIoutloud/playlists">Browse episodes on YouTube ↗</a></p><div id="episode-feed"></div></section>
<section class="hosts-section" id="hosts"><header class="section-header"><h2>Two co-hosts, different paths into AI.</h2></header><div class="host-columns"><article class="host-santosh"><span class="host-photo host-photo-santosh"><img src="{{asset "eaol/santosh-headshot.webp"}}" width="140" height="140" alt="Santosh Savel" loading="lazy"></span><h3>Santosh Savel</h3><p>For more than 13 years, Santosh Savel has built products and led teams in healthcare. His career spans operations, sales, project management, and digital product leadership, with experience in specialty pharmacy and patient engagement. His work centers on turning complex operational problems into technology that serves patients, providers, and the teams supporting them.</p><p>Santosh has led cross-functional teams, managing product roadmaps, budgets, and vendor relationships. His work includes AI chatbots, digital self-service, patient onboarding, and process redesign. He approaches AI through the workflow: understanding the problem, deciding where technology helps, and building something people can use.</p><p>He launched Neural Gains Weekly at MindOverMoney.ai to document his AI experiments in public. With no coding background or computer science degree, he shares practical explanations, prompts, and lessons from building. Through the newsletter and Explore AI Out Loud, Santosh helps professionals explore where AI fits in their work and learn from both the wins and the mistakes.</p><nav aria-label="Santosh’s profiles"><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/ssavel" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LinkedIn ↗</a><a href="https://x.com/SantoshSavel" target="_blank" rel="noopener">X ↗</a></nav></article><article class="host-brandon"><img class="host-photo host-photo-brandon" src="{{asset "eaol/brandon-headshot.webp"}}" width="140" height="140" alt="Brandon Ratay" loading="lazy"><h3>Brandon Ratay</h3><p>For nearly two decades, Brandon Ratay has helped organizations connect with employees, customers, and communities through marketing, communications, and storytelling. His experience spans television and digital media, public relations, corporate marketing, content development, and enterprise communications, supporting national brands, professional sports organizations, and large teams.</p><p>While the roles and industries have changed, much of Brandon's work has centered on the same challenge: turning complex ideas into information people can understand, trust, and act on. As artificial intelligence began transforming the workplace, he saw an opportunity for professionals to move beyond the hype and apply AI in practical ways that enhance productivity, creativity, and communication while delivering measurable business outcomes.</p><p>Through webinars, podcasts, training programs, and thought leadership initiatives, Brandon shares real-world applications of AI for everyday work and life. His focus remains on helping professionals and organizations embrace innovation with purpose—keeping relationships and meaningful communication at the center.</p></article></div><section class="show-socials" aria-labelledby="socials-title"><div><h3 id="socials-title">Follow Explore AI Out Loud</h3><p>Find us on Instagram and TikTok.</p></div><nav class="show-social-links" aria-label="Explore AI Out Loud social profiles"><a class="show-social-link" href="https://www.instagram.com/exploreaioutloud/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><img src="{{asset "eaol/icons/instagram.png"}}" width="24" height="24" alt="">Instagram ↗</a><a class="show-social-link" href="https://www.tiktok.com/@exploreaioutloud" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><img src="{{asset "eaol/icons/tiktok.png"}}" width="24" height="24" alt="">TikTok ↗</a></nav></section></section>
